{"pull": {"id": "number:21092", "number": 21092, "title": "KAFKA-19972: Bump delivery count on session release", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2025-12-05T17:20:15Z", "closed_at": "2025-12-05T21:51:47Z", "merged_at": "2025-12-05T21:51:47Z", "user": {"login": "apoorvmittal10", "id": 2861565, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjE1NjU=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2861565?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10", "html_url": "https://github.com/apoorvmittal10", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "If a client application crashes then it can go in infinte loop where\nsame records will be delivered. Though previously we chose to decrease\nthe delivery count on session release as we didn't have throttling\nsupport. Now when we do then it makes sense to bump the delivery count\non session close. Also as share-groups clients should ideally not have\npre-fetched data hence it's safe to bump the delivery count on session\nrelease.\n\nI have not removed the code to decrease the delivery count as that\nfunctionality is well tested and we might need at the time of\npre-fetching support or in cases where we do need not to bump the\ndelivery count, in future.\n\nReviewers: Andrew Schofield <aschofield@confluent.io>\n", "labels": [{"id": 838330122, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw4MzgzMzAxMjI=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/core", "name": "core", "color": "ed5a86", "default": false, "description": "Kafka Broker", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 6979675393, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABoAVlAQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/KIP-932", "name": "KIP-932", "color": "DA462F", "default": false, "description": "Queues for Kafka", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7491388177, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABvoWDEQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/clients", "name": "clients", "color": "ededed", "default": false, "description": null, "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7522931565, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABwGbTbQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/ci-approved", "name": "ci-approved", "color": "ffffff", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/21092"}, "reviews": [], "review_comments": [], "issue_comments": [], "commits": [], "files": [], "timeline": [], "_partial": "search", "_source": "extra-data/github-search/author_apoorvmittal10_is_pr.json"}